// A warded grimoire. Written to exercise the library theme.

= wake #theme library #speed 18
set volumes = Three
set candle = lit

The book is warm under your hand.

Ink stirs beneath the vellum, and the letters surface one at a time, as
though someone were writing them just ahead of your reading.

Speak the word of opening. #password sable
-> shelf

= shelf #clear
The Shelf of Quiet Things #title
The candle is {candle}. {volumes} volumes lie open before you.
* The Astronomer's Complaint -> astronomer
* A Bestiary of Small Griefs -> bestiary
* Attend to the candle
  * Pinch it out
    set candle = out
    Darkness, and the smell of tallow. #delay 1200
  * Trim the wick
    set candle = burning bright
    The flame steadies. #delay 1200
  * Leave it -> back
* Close the book -> end

= astronomer #clear
The Astronomer's Complaint #title
She numbered the stars for forty years and found one missing.

Nobody would tell her which.
* Back -> back

= bestiary #clear
A Bestiary of Small Griefs #title
Entry the eleventh: the Lamentable Moth, which eats only letters
of apology, and is therefore always hungry.
* Back -> back
